description	"Jedi Gladiator

A rushdown Jedi with uniquely high-damage and extended-combo Fast saber styles.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Cyan/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Chain Limit: 4
-- 100% more damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)
- Protect (2) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block/Focus (2)"